    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46366" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sūdātōrĭus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj.
		sudo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>belonging to</i> or <i>serving for sweating</i>,
				<i>sudatory.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Adj.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">unctiones,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Stich. 1, 3, 73</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">qualitas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cassiod. Var. 2, 39 <i>med.</i></span></i>
			 — </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sūdātōrĭum</span></b> ,
				ii, n., <i>a
			sweatingbath</i>, <i>sweating-room</i>, <i>a sudatory</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">circa balinea ac sudatoria,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Vit. Beat. 7, 2</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. Ep. 51, 6</span></i>.</div>
